{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_17", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_17.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, Petra\u2014Miss Petra.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Is it that, that is first and foremost with you?", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Not the matter itself?", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Not the truth?\u2014not my father's big generous heart?", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Certainly\u2014of course\u2014that too.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "No, thank you; you have betrayed yourself, Mr. Hovstad, and now I shall never trust you again in anything.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Can you really take it so amiss in me that it is mostly for your sake\u2014?", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "What I am angry with you for, is for not having been honest with my father.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "You talked to him as if the truth and the good of the community were what lay nearest to your heart.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "You have made fools of both my father and me.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "You are not the man you made yourself out to be.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "And that I shall never forgive you-never!", "para": 5, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "You ought not to speak so bitterly, Miss Petra\u2014least of all now.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Why not now, especially?", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Because your father cannot do without my help.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (looking him up and down).", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you that sort of man too?", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "For shame!", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "No, no, I am not.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "This came upon me so unexpectedly\u2014you must believe that.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "I know what to believe.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Goodbye.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (coming from the printing room, hurriedly and with an air of mystery).", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Damnation, Hovstad!\u2014(Sees PETRA.)", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, this is awkward\u2014", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "There is the book; you must give it to some one else.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes towards the door.)", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (following her).", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "But, Miss Stockmann\u2014", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Goodbye.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes out.)", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "I say\u2014Mr. Hovstad\u2014", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Well well!\u2014what is it?", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "The Mayor is outside in the printing room.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The Mayor, did you say?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes he wants to speak to you.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "He came in by the back door\u2014didn't want to be seen, you understand.", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "What can he want?", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Wait a bit\u2014I will go myself.", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes to the door of the printing room, opens it, bows and invites PETER STOCKMANN in.)", "para": 21, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Just see, Aslaksen, that no one\u2014", "para": 21, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite so.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes into the printing-room.)", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "You did not expect to see me here, Mr. Hovstad?", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I confess I did not.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (looking round).", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "You are very snug in here\u2014very nice indeed.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh\u2014", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "And here I come, without any notice, to take up your time!", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "By all means, Mr. Mayor.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "I am at your service.", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "But let me relieve you of your\u2014(takes STOCKMANN's hat and stick and puts them on a chair).", "para": 28, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Won't you sit down?", "para": 28, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (sitting down by the table).", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "(HOVSTAD sits down.)", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "I have had an extremely annoying experience to-day, Mr. Hovstad.", "para": 29, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Really?", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah well, I expect with all the various business you have to attend to\u2014", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "The Medical Officer of the Baths is responsible for what happened today.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Indeed?", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "The Doctor?", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "He has addressed a kind of report to the Baths Committee on the subject of certain supposed defects in the Baths.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Has he indeed?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes\u2014has he not told you?", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "I thought he said\u2014", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, yes\u2014it is true he did mention something about\u2014", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (coming from the printing-room).", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "I ought to have that copy.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (angrily).", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Ahem!\u2014there it is on the desk.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (taking it).", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Right.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "But look there\u2014that is the thing I was speaking of!", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that is the Doctor's article, Mr. Mayor.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, is THAT what you were speaking about?", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that is it.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you think of it?", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, I am only a layman\u2014and I have only taken a very cursory glance at it.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}